      "description": "Watch Olympiakos Piraeus vs Jagiellonia Białystok highlights and goals from UEFA Europa League on ReFooty: Football Highlights Hub. Match played on September 16, 2026. A tactical battle in Europe On September 16, 2026, Olympiakos Piraeus and Jagiellonia Białystok faced off in a compelling UEFA Europa League fixture. Both sides entered the pitch determined to assert their dominance in a high-stakes encounter where momentum shifted throughout the evening. A game of fine margins The match ignited early when Kajetan Szmyt struck for Jagiellonia in the 20th minute, finishing off a clever setup from Nik Prelec . Olympiakos responded with resilience, working their way back into the game until Armando Gonzalez found the equalizer in the 43rd minute, courtesy of an assist from Panagiotis Retsos . The second half proved to be a test of nerves as the physicality intensified, reflected in a flurry of yellow cards shown to both sides. With the clock ticking down and the tension mounting, Roman Yaremchuk emerged as the hero. In the 84th minute, he capitalized on a perfectly weighted ball from Remo Freuler to find the net, clinching the decisive goal that ultimately decided the contest."
